  "meta": {
    "description": "Inputs: sessionId, summary. Builds the handover UUI (AR-14), then POSTs refer to the OpenAI call with target_uri sip:agent@<referDomain>?User-to-User=<hex>;encoding=hex. Twilio receives the REFER and posts the Refer-To to AR-53. Returns {ok, message}."
  },
